   "about": "An ACTIVE top-level set whose only rule allows on resource.a == 'y' OR subject.parityR41HeldPipProject == 'v'; the case declares that GENERAL without ${subject.isM2M}. A PROJECT PIP customization adds a whole ${subject.isM2M} to its requestAttributes: project-read-other answers 400 if the tenant reads the PROJECT declaration, true if it reads the uploaded one or ignores the PROJECT level. A CUSTOMER PIP customization then takes it out: customer-read-other answers true if CUSTOMER applies after PROJECT, 400 if PROJECT applies last. The third step deletes the CUSTOMER customization, and uncustomer-read-other answers 400 again if the PROJECT one holds the tenant. The runner deletes both customizations before the last control.",
